P5-L02 witness: same Byte Relay with an explicit implementation pin on the egress component.
@{system byte_relay_pinned "Byte Relay (pinned)"}
@{type Bytes}
@{implementation CPU_WASM64}
@{component ingress}
@{component egress}
@{pin egress CPU_WASM64}
@{port ingress.bytes out: Bytes public}
@{port egress.bytes in: Bytes public}
@{data relay ingress.bytes -> egress.bytes mode=copy}
